title    Undercity
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    Neon Metropolis (level7) option, round 2 (#1053): cyberpunk drum and bass in C-sharp minor at 172. A sliding square-wave hook (a hover drone's whine) over a reese bass, FM-bell chord stabs, glitch fills and a siren down the street every fourth bar. The A section turns C#m-A-B, the B section F#m-A-G#m to G#7. The last eight bars lift a minor third, to E minor. Layers: hook, reese, stabs, siren and glitches from the start, then a chopped acoustic break at 2x, the hook doubled on a metallic bell at 3x, sixteenth shakers and glitch stutters at FRENZY. The helicopter's boss section chops the reese into rotor sixteenths, turns the hook Phrygian (D natural) over orchestra hits and puts the police siren on every other bar; the sting is C-sharp major.
tempo    172
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.22

# untagged voices are the base layer, the hook among them (layers only add); the intro plays every layer
voice lead   square   vol=0.42 pan=-0.05
voice reese  reese    vol=0.62
voice stabs  fmbell   vol=0.2 pan=0.3 center=G#4
voice siren  siren    vol=0.2 pan=0.5
voice zap    glitch   vol=0.32 pan=-0.25
voice stab   orchhit  vol=0.34 pan=0.1
voice rise   riser    vol=0.26
voice kick   kick     vol=0.75 layer=drums
voice snare  snare    vol=0.62 layer=drums
voice hat    hat      vol=0.32 pan=0.3 layer=drums
voice ping   fmbell   vol=0.18 pan=-0.3 layer=lead
voice shake  shaker   vol=0.3 pan=-0.4 layer=frenzy
voice fzap   glitch   vol=0.26 pan=0.25 layer=frenzy

pattern intro
lead  | _ | .- G#4 . .--- ~C#5------- |
ping  | _ | .- G#4 . .--- ~C#5------- |
reese | C#2------- .------- | C#2------- B2------- |
siren | G#4--------------- | _ |
zap   | .... .... x.x. xxxx | .... x... .... .... |
rise  | _ | C6--------------- |
kick  | X... .... .... .... | X... .... ..X. .... |
snare | .... .... .... .... | .... .... XxXx XXXX |

pattern A
lead  | G#4--- E4- G#4- ~C#5--- B4- G#4- | E5------- D#5- C#5- B4- G#4- | A4--- C#5- E5- ~A5--- G#5- E5- | F#5------- D#5- B4- F#5- D#5- |
ping  | G#4--- E4- G#4- ~C#5--- B4- G#4- | E5------- D#5- C#5- B4- G#4- | A4--- C#5- E5- ~A5--- G#5- E5- | F#5------- D#5- B4- F#5- D#5- |
reese | C#2------- .- C#2 E2- B2-- | C#2------- .- C#2 E2- G#2-- | A2------- .- A2 C#2- E2-- | B2------- .- B2 D#2- F#2-- |
stabs | [C#m]-- [C#m]- .- [C#m] .--- [C#m]- .- | % | [A]-- [A]- .- [A] .--- [A]- .- | [B]-- [B]- .- [B] .--- [B]- .- |
siren | _ | _ | _ | E5--------------- |
zap   | .... .... .... .... | .... .... .... ..x. | .... .... .... .... | .... .... x.x. xxxx |
kick  | X... .... ..X. .... | X... .... ..X. ..x. | X... .... ..X. .... | X... .... ..X. .... |
snare | .... X..x .x.. X... | .... X... .x.. X..x | .... X..x .x.. X... | .... X..x .xX. XxXx |
hat   | x.x. x.xx x.x. x.x. | % | % | % |
shake | xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx | % | % | % |
fzap  | .... .... xx.. x.xx | % | % | .... .... xxxx xxxx |

pattern A2 from A
lead  | G#4--- E4- G#4- ~C#5--- B4- G#4- | E5------- D#5- C#5- B4- G#4- | A4--- C#5- E5- ~A5--- G#5- E5- | F#5--- G#5--- A5--- B5--- |
ping  | G#4--- E4- G#4- ~C#5--- B4- G#4- | E5------- D#5- C#5- B4- G#4- | A4--- C#5- E5- ~A5--- G#5- E5- | F#5--- G#5--- A5--- B5--- |
siren | _ | _ | _ | _ |

pattern B from A
lead  | A5--- F#5- C#5- A4--- C#5- F#5- | E5------- C#5- A4- E5- C#5- | D#5--- B4- G#4- D#5--- E5- F#5- | G#5------- .--- C5- D#5- |
ping  | A5--- F#5- C#5- A4--- C#5- F#5- | E5------- C#5- A4- E5- C#5- | D#5--- B4- G#4- D#5--- E5- F#5- | G#5------- .--- C5- D#5- |
reese | F#2------- .- F#2 A2- C#2-- | A2------- .- A2 C#2- E2-- | G#2------- .- G#2 B2- D#2-- | G#2------- .- G#2 C2- D#2-- |
stabs | [F#m]-- [F#m]- .- [F#m] .--- [F#m]- .- | [A]-- [A]- .- [A] .--- [A]- .- | [G#m]-- [G#m]- .- [G#m] .--- [G#m]- .- | [G#7]-- [G#7]- .- [G#7] .--- [G#7]- .- |

pattern B2 from B
lead  | A5--- F#5- C#5- A4--- C#5- F#5- | E5------- C#5- A4- E5- C#5- | D#5--- B4- G#4- D#5--- E5- F#5- | G#5------- F#5- E5- D#5- C5- |
ping  | A5--- F#5- C#5- A4--- C#5- F#5- | E5------- C#5- A4- E5- C#5- | D#5--- B4- G#4- D#5--- E5- F#5- | G#5------- F#5- E5- D#5- C5- |
siren | _ | _ | _ | _ |
rise  | _ | _ | _ | C6--------------- |

play intro
loop A A2 B B2 A A2 A+3 A2+3

# Boss section: the police helicopter. The reese chops into rotor sixteenths, the hook turns C# Phrygian (D natural)
# over C#m / D, orchestra hits land in base and the siren wails every other bar; in Y the hook climbs. The sting is C# major.
pattern X
lead  | C#5--- D5- C#5- G#4--- E4- G#4- | A4------- F#4- A4- D5- A4- | C#5--- D5- E5- G#5--- E5- D5- | C5------- D#5- C5- G#4- C5- |
ping  | C#5--- D5- C#5- G#4--- E4- G#4- | A4------- F#4- A4- D5- A4- | C#5--- D5- E5- G#5--- E5- D5- | C5------- D#5- C5- G#4- C5- |
reese | C#2 C#2 C#2 . C#2 C#2 C#2 . C#2 C#2 C#2 . C#2 C#2 C#3 C#2 | D2 D2 D2 . D2 D2 D2 . D2 D2 D2 . D2 D2 D3 D2 | C#2 C#2 C#2 . C#2 C#2 C#2 . C#2 C#2 C#2 . C#2 C#2 C#3 C#2 | G#2 G#2 G#2 . G#2 G#2 G#2 . G#2 G#2 G#2 . G#2 G#2 G#2 G#2 |
stabs | [C#m]-- [C#m]- .- [C#m] .--- [C#m]- .- | [D]-- [D]- .- [D] .--- [D]- .- | [C#m]-- [C#m]- .- [C#m] .--- [C#m]- .- | [G#7]-- [G#7]- .- [G#7] .--- [G#7]- .- |
stab  | [C#m]!--- .------- [C#m]!--- | [D]!--- .----------- | [C#m]!--- .------- [C#m]!--- | [G#]!--- [G#]!--- [G#7]!------- |
siren | _ | C#5--------------- | _ | C#5--------------- |
zap   | .... .... .... ..x. | % | % | .... .... x.x. xxxx |
kick  | X... .... ..X. .... | X... .... ..X. ..x. | % | X... ..x. ..X. x... |
snare | .... X..x .x.. X... | % | % | .... X..x .xX. XXXX |
hat   | x.x. x.xx x.x. x.x. | % | % | % |
shake | xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx | % | % | % |
fzap  | .... .... xx.. x.xx | % | % | % |

pattern Y from X
lead  | G#5--- A5--- G#5--- E5--- | F#5------- D5--- A4--- | C#5--- E5--- G#5--- A5--- | G#5------- C5- D#5- G#5- C5- |
ping  | G#5--- A5--- G#5--- E5--- | F#5------- D5--- A4--- | C#5--- E5--- G#5--- A5--- | G#5------- C5- D#5- G#5- C5- |
rise  | _ | _ | _ | C6--------------- |

pattern S
lead  | C#5--- F5--- G#5--- C#6--- | C#6------- .------- |
ping  | C#5--- F5--- G#5--- C#6--- | C#6------- .------- |
stab  | [C#]!--- .--- [C#]!--- [F#]!--- | [C#]!------- .--- [C#]!--- |
reese | C#2--- C#2--- C#2--- C#2--- | C#2------- .------- |
stabs | [C#]-- [C#]- .- [C#] .--- [C#]- .- | [C#]------- .------- |
kick  | X... X... X... X... | X... .... ..X. x.xx |
snare | .... .... xxxx XXXX | .... X... .... xxxx |
hat   | x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. | % |
zap   | .... .... .... .... | .... .... .... x.xx |

boss  X Y
sting S
